          <p class="body-s" style="max-width:40ch">Every formula is built on plant-derived cleansers and essential oils. It behaves exactly like the cleaner you are used to, minus the things you never signed up for.</p>
          <a class="btn btn-primary" href="#ingredients">See the ingredient list
